<div class="about-row">
  <div class="about-body">
    <p>I've spent a dozen years in product, strategy, and revenue roles across consumer brands and technology — starting out in the Walmart ecosystem in Bentonville, then a stretch in New York, and eventually a move west after an MBA.</p>
    <p>I've always been a tinkerer, so when AI started to feel less like a buzzword and more like a real enabler, I couldn't leave it alone. I used an internal project as an excuse to learn it properly — and ended up automating a big chunk of my own job. That was sort of the point: the time it frees up is what lets me go build the higher-value tools and enablements I wouldn't have gotten to otherwise. I try not to take myself too seriously while I'm at it; if we end up working together, that's usually the first thing you'll notice.</p>
  </div>
